Break sctp connectivity between enb and gnb on eNB side
    [Arguments]    ${enb_id}=0    ${du_id}=${0}
    [Documentation]    Verify sctp connection is active on device then block sctp protocol by firewall rule.
    ...    :param enb_id:    ENB id - releated to test line configuration
    ...    :param du_id: DU id(Distributed Unit) - id related to Test Line configuration - gnb.dus[]
    enblink.break_sctp_connectivity_between_enb_and_gnb    bts_id=${enb_id}  du_id=${du_id}

Restore sctp connectivity between enb and gnb on eNB side
    [Arguments]    ${enb_id}=0    ${du_id}=${0}
    [Documentation]    Verify sctp connection is inactive on device then unblock sctp protocol by firewall rule.
    ...    :param enb_id:    ENB id - releated to test line configuration
    ...    :param du_id: DU id(Distributed Unit) - id related to Test Line configuration - gnb.dus[]
    enblink.restore_sctp_connectivity_between_enb_and_gnb    bts_id=${enb_id}  du_id=${du_id}

Verify sctp connection has been terminated on eNB side
    [Arguments]    ${enb_id}=0    ${du_id}=${0}
